        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "7d18dab1-73de-593e-a1e7-3d9f20fb2950",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Andy Fickman, Nichole Millard, Kathryn Price, Audrey Wells, Dwayne Johnson, H. Lee Peterson, Roselyn Sánchez\n- Companies: Walt Disney Feature Animation, Walt Disney Pictures\n- Films: Pocahontas, The Game Plan, The Little Mermaid, Aladdin, Dinosaur, Home on the Range, The Prince and the Pauper, Rush Hour 2, Boat Trip, Act of Valor\n- Topics: film credits, production, directing, writing, starring, editing\n\nFacts:\n- Pocahontas is a 1995 American animated musical romantic-comedy-drama film produced by Walt Disney Feature Animation for Walt Disney Pictures.\n- H. Lee Peterson was an assistant editor for The Little Mermaid.\n- H. Lee Peterson was the lead film editor for Aladdin, Pocahontas, Dinosaur, Home on the Range, and the Mickey Mouse short film The Prince and the Pauper.\n- Rush Hour 2 was released in 2001, and Roselyn Sánchez appeared in it.\n- Boat Trip was released in 2002, and Roselyn Sánchez appeared in it.\n- The Game Plan is a 2007 American family comedy film directed by Andy Fickman and written by Nichole Millard, Kathryn Price, and Audrey Wells.\n- The Game Plan stars Dwayne Johnson, and it was the last film in which he was billed with his ring name \"The Rock.\"\n- Roselyn Sánchez appeared in The Game Plan.\n- Act of Valor was released in 2012, and Roselyn Sánchez appeared in it.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "3decebbe-d7aa-57ea-880f-e3c77fa26efb",
        "text": "Page: Pocahontas (1995 film). Sentence: Pocahontas is a 1995 American animated musical romantic-comedy-drama film produced by Walt Disney Feature Animation for Walt Disney Pictures.\nPage: The Game Plan (film). Sentence: The Game Plan is a 2007 American family comedy film directed by Andy Fickman and written by Nichole Millard, Kathryn Price and Audrey Wells and starring Dwayne \"The Rock\" Johnson (marking the last film in which Johnson uses his ring name \"The Rock\" in billing).\nPage: H. Lee Peterson. Sentence: His credits for Walt Disney Pictures include being an assistant editor for \"The Little Mermaid\", and the lead film editor for \"Aladdin\", \"Pocahontas\", \"Dinosaur\", \"Home on the Range\" and the short film \"The Prince and the Pauper; starring Mickey Mouse\".\nPage: Roselyn Sánchez. Sentence: In film, Sánchez has appeared in \"Rush Hour 2\" (2001), \"Boat Trip\" (2002), \"The Game Plan\" (2007), and \"Act of Valor\" (2012).",
